<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Manuscript Decision Notification</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .container {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0px 0px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: auto;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #d4a017;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
        }
        .header h2 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 20px;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 20px;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .content p {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .cta-button {
            display: block;
            width: fit-content;
            margin: 20px auto;
            background-color: #d4a017;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
        }
        .cta-button:hover {
            background-color: #b28314;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #777;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
        }
        .footer a {
            color: #d4a017;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .footer a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h2>Manuscript Decision Notification</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Dear {{authorName}},</p>
            <p>We have completed the review process for your manuscript submitted to <strong>SLUJST</strong>.</p>
            <p><strong>Manuscript Title:</strong> {{manuscriptTitle}}</p>
            <p><strong>Decision:</strong> <span style="color: #174ea6; font-weight: bold;">{{decision}}</span></p>

            {{#if isAccepted}}
                <p>Congratulations! Your manuscript has been accepted for publication. Our editorial team will contact you regarding the next steps.</p>
            {{/if}}

            {{#if isRevisionRequired}}
                <p>Your manuscript requires revisions before it can be accepted. Please review the comments provided by our reviewers and submit a revised version by <strong>{{revisionDeadline}}</strong>.</p>
                <a href="https://slu-jst.vercel.app/author" class="cta-button">Submit Revised Manuscript</a>
            {{/if}}

            {{#if isRejected}}
    <p>Unfortunately, after careful consideration, we have decided not to proceed with the publication of your manuscript. We appreciate your submission and encourage you to consider submitting future work to <strong>SLUJST</strong>.</p>
    
    {{#if rejectionReason}}
        <p><strong>Reason for Rejection:</strong> {{rejectionReason}}</p>
    {{/if}}
{{/if}}

            <p>If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us at <a href="mailto:TEA@slujst.com.ng">TEA@slujst.com.ng</a>.</p>
            <p>Best Regards,<br><strong>Editorial Team</strong></p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; {{year}} Sule Lamido University Journal of Science and Technology. All Rights Reserved.</p>
            <p>For inquiries, contact <a href="mailto:TEA@slujst.com.ng">TEA@slujst.com.ng</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
